{
 "id": 1263302,
 "titulo": "v440 Update Details",
 "fecha": 1536748792766,
 "modificada": 1732824317460,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1263302",
 "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">This is CM_Friday from the Marvel Future Fight team. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">We&rsquo;re being greeted by powerful and mysterious characters from an alternate world, and other equally large changes are coming to Marvel Future Fight!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">New Characters are being released! Four Characters from MARVEL&rsquo;s upcoming &ldquo;Infinity Warps&rdquo; have been added!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">Quicksilver, Agent Venom, and Medusa have gotten new Uniforms!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">More Characters that can surpass their limits and uncover their hidden Potential have also been added!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">The King of Wakanda, Black Panther, is receiving his Tier-3 Upgrade!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">World Boss Ultimate: Thanos has been added to wreak havoc and put a stop to your team!<br /> <br />And lastly, we have added the following:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 38.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: #333333;\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Heroic Quest: play special story missions to earn rewards</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 38.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: #333333;\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Uniform Collection system: collect rewards by expanding your uniform collection</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 38.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"color: #333333;\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Various gameplay improvements</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">For more information, check out the update details below!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">Added 4 New Characters!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">An alternate world brings forth new characters to join Marvel Future Fight! </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Arachknight, Ghost Panther, Iron Hammer, and Weapon Hex</span></strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\"> are now in the game.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121747/21121.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* The Skill de&#115;criptions shown above are at Skill Level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* You can obtain Iron Hammer by purchasing the Premium Hero Chest and via Biometric &#83;electors.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* You can obtain Ghost Panther by purchasing &ldquo;Get 20 Biometrics Daily&rdquo; from the Mission Shop.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: red;\">*</span> <span style=\"color: red;\">You can obtain Weapon Hex by purchasing &ldquo;Get 20 X-Genes Daily&rdquo; from the Mission Shop.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* You can obtain Arachknight through the new mode, Heroic Quest.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> &nbsp;Added 3 New Uniforms!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Quicksilver, Agent Venom, and Medusa </span></strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">will get new Uniforms!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Loki</span></strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\"> and <strong>Hawkeye</strong> will get new Uniforms within a later update this month, so hang on tight!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121740/1.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121926/10013.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* The Skill de&#115;criptions shown above are at Skill Level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* 3 new Uniforms will be on sale during the event period. You can check them out on the Marvel Universe menu and by going to the Uniform Room.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> &nbsp;Black Panther&rsquo;s Tier-3 Advancement</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">You will now be able to unlock Black Panther&rsquo;s Tier-3 Skill!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Witness how Black Panther defends Wakanda using this new skill!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"https://media.giphy.com/media/SIpWZaHH6b1oMK2NZJ/giphy.gif\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121740/2.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> 7 More Characters Can Achieve Their Potential!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">After the update, 7 more Characters will be able to achieve their Potential! <strong>Arachknight, Ghost Panther, Iron Hammer, Weapon Hex, Quicksilver, Agent Venom, and Medusa</strong> will each have their Potential unlocked.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Unlock a Character&rsquo;s Potential to level them up to level 70!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121740/3.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">A New Mode: Heroic Quest</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Experience the stories of different Marvel Future Fight Characters in the latest mode, Heroic Quest. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">By playing Heroic Quest, you can get Biometrics and items that can help you strengthen your characters!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">There are some characters that you can only acquire in Quest Packs.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/131324/11q.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">- The [Hero for Hire], [Retired Hero], and [Protector of K'un-Lun] Quest Packs are available for free.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">- The [Friendly Neighbor from Another Dimension] Quest Pack can be purchased with 750 Crystals. You get additional rewards on this Quest Pack compared to normal Quest Packs. </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 9.0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -9.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -1.0; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 9.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">There are several chapters per Quest Pack <strong>and they are only available for a certain period of time.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">When the chapters in the Quest Pack expire, the Quest Pack expires as well.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* When a quest period ends, You can finish the Quest instantly using Crystals.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121740/5.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">By clearing a Heroic Quest Chapter, you get instant rewards and accumulate Crystals in a Crystal Chest.</span><span style=\"color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121740/6.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">Even&nbsp;if you complete&nbsp;the chapter and the chest is full, you will not receive the&nbsp;Crystal Chest reward.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong><span style=\"color: red;\">*&nbsp; In-app billing is required to unlock a full Crystal Chest.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in .0001pt .25in;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">*&nbsp; The purchase price is based on the Google Play Store.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;World Boss Ultimate: Thanos Added!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">The Mad Titan is finally revealing his true power! </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">Challenge Thanos in his own stage, World Boss Ultimate: Thanos!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121816/71.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">- You can get Tier-3 Materials by defeating Thanos!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">- You can get Titan Records of all types by playing this stage. Titan Record: Combat / Blast / Speed / Universal!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* Tier-3 Advancement is only possible if the Character&rsquo;s Type Affinity matches the Titan Record&rsquo;s Type.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">Ex: A Combat Type Character can only advance to Tier-3 if you have enough Titan Record: Combat in your inventory.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;Uniform Collection Feature Added!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">There are a lot of uniforms available in Marvel Future Fight and a new feature has been added to make use of that! Collect Uniforms according to themes and earn rewards by achieving certain conditions!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/09/121751/8.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">Once you meet the conditions listed, the register &#98;utton for the uniform will be displayed. <br />When you register that uniform in the Uniform Collection, the Character is colored in and highlighted.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/09/121751/9.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/09/121751/10.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">-&nbsp;</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">Complete a theme and earn additional rewards!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 38.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;Loyalty Point System now added!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">The store provides many items that can make your Characters stronger! With this update, you can now accumulate Loyalty Points every time you purchase a specific item!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/09/121751/11.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">- The amount of Loyalty Points you can get is different depending on the product!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\"><br /></span></strong><strong style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: red;\">* Only in-app purchases can accumulate Loyalty Points.&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/09/121751/12.png\" /><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">- Once you accumulate enough Loyalty Points, you can get rewards such as Crystals, Mythic Uru Chest, 6★ Mega Rank Up Ticket, and other items.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121926/10014.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red;\">* Your Loyalty Point progress and rewards will reset at a specified time, so make sure to keep the reset time in mind!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;Other Game Improvements</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">1. </span></strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">The timing behind the villains&rsquo; location changes and spawn time in Story Mode Chapter 3: &ldquo;The Calm Before the Storm&rdquo; has been reduced to allow smoother gameplay of the level. </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">2. </span></strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">There will be a pop-up notification if you choose a recommended Character for a different difficulty in Villain Siege than the difficulty you are planning to enter.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/09/121751/13.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"color: #4472c4; font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>-&nbsp;A pop-up notification will ask for your confirmation before you re-enter the stage!</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">3. </span></strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Improvements have been made to your previous Shadowland challenge records and progression displays.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/09/121751/14.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">- When you tap on the icon, you will be able to see information of the floors you cleared from the previous week.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">Ex: Floor 1 information will be shown while attempting Floor 2, and Floor 2 information will be shown while attempting Floor 3.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/09/121751/15.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">- </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">Previous challenge information will not appear if you did not clear any floors before the reset.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/09/121751/16.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">-</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">You can also check the previous season's challenge information for each stage.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">4. </span></strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">World Boss Invasion chest has been improved to</span><span style=\"color: #333333;\"> display the number of boxes available for claiming.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><br /> <strong>5. </strong></span><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Alliance Raid: Raid Boss Loot chest has been improved so that you can view the items obtainable from the Loot chest. </span><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><br /> <!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--></span></strong><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/09/121751/17.png\" /><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><br /> </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">6. </span></strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">It is now easier to check your Uniform EXP gained per Character after you clear a mission.</span><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><br /></span><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121747/10012.png\" /><br /> </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">7. </span></strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">You can now see the rewards for any number of Auto-Repeat attempts in one reward window.</span><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><br /> <!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--></span><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121807/19.png\" /><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><br /> </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">8. </span></strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Once you have reached the maximum capacity for Assemble Points, a pop-up notification will ask whether you want to purchase Energy with Assemble Points.</span><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121807/20.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">- </span><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">You can purchase energy without entering the Assemble Point Shop!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\"><strong>9.</strong> Added a feature where you can claim all of your Daily Challenge rewards with one &#98;utton.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121807/21.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">- </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #4472c4;\">You can now claim all of your rewards by pressing the &ldquo;Acquire All&rdquo; &#98;utton!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\"><strong>10.</strong> You can now check where to obtain Biometrics of Characters that have unlocked their Potential!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/09/121807/22.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">Other Game Fixes</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">1.</span></strong> <span style=\"color: #333333;\">Fixed an issue where the message stating that your character ranked up does not appear when ranking up using a Hero Chest.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>2. </strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Fixed an issue in Timeline Battle where, after watching a Skill Preview video from the Uniform Store prior to engaging in a friendly match, you can battle your friend with the Uniform you previewed.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>3</strong>.&nbsp;Fixed an issue where the information window that displays how to acquire Cable in the &ldquo;Cable&rsquo;s Clone&rdquo; quest displays how to obtain a Phoenix Feather instead.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>4.&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Fixed a visual glitch where the X-Men and X-Force Epic Quests showed a shared daily limit for farmable X-Genes between characters.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>5.&nbsp;</strong>Fixed an issue in Alliance Raid mode where the preset Team Bonus effect for a Character cannot be &#115;elected because the &ldquo;Set Team&rdquo; &#98;utton is missing.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>6. </strong>Fixed an issue where the cooldown for Quicksilver&rsquo;s skills &ldquo;Explosive Acceleration&rdquo; and &ldquo;Not yet?&rdquo; are applied twice.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>7. </strong>Fixed an issue with Deadpool where upon reaching Tier-3, his character utilization tip does not show up at all.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>8.</strong> Fixed an issue in World Boss Ultimate where \"Blade Twister\" hits an illusion and the effects are passed on to the main character as well.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">We hope you enjoy the September update!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; color: #333333; mso-fareast-language: JA;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Thank you!</span></span></p>"
}